about a fellow offender:— Says a motoring writer in a Sunday | paper: ‘Itis time that a period were | put to the era of the trap on the open road, & that the interests of the public | at large were considered by attacking the real evil—the dangerous & inconsiderate driver. Fortunately, he con-

